1. [<span class="qcm-letter">A</span> 35 heures.](ENT_CSP_T5_Q_V01_Q03_VRAI)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">B</span> 39 heures.](ENT_CSP_T5_Q_V01_Q03_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">C</span> 45 heures.](ENT_CSP_T5_Q_V01_Q03_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">D</span> 30 heures.](ENT_CSP_T5_Q_V01_Q03_FAUX)

