1. [<span class="qcm-letter">A</span> 35 heures.](ENT_CSP_T5_Q_V03_Q01_VRAI)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">B</span> 39 heures.](ENT_CSP_T5_Q_V03_Q01_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">C</span> 45 heures.](ENT_CSP_T5_Q_V03_Q01_FAUX)
