1. [<span class="qcm-letter">A</span> Le coq gaulois.](ENT_CSP_ALL_MIS_V05_Q01_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">B</span> La tour Eiffel.](ENT_CSP_ALL_MIS_V05_Q01_FAUX)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">C</span> Marianne.](ENT_CSP_ALL_MIS_V05_Q01_VRAI)
1. [<span class="qcm-letter">D</span> Le Louvre.](ENT_CSP_ALL_MIS_V05_Q01_FAUX)

